{"type":"message","id":"d33caae4","parentId":"23c86077","timestamp":"2026-05-26T10:46:01.512Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 for POST /send. The GET /history endpoint works with X-API-Key but the POST /send does not. This could be a Cloudflare Workers error or an issue with the platform's authentication for write operations.\n\nLet me try the history endpoint to see if it works with Bearer token too:\n","thinkingSignature":"a9b147239ec9654e322725e020256d70ebeedf38dac6c53cde07acfb087a832f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0t6puuspr1mq_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different auth methods for POST /send\necho \"=== Try 1: X-API-Key with JSON body ===\" && curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'\n\necho -e \"\\n\\n=== Try 2: Bearer in Authorization header ===\" && curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'\n\necho -e \"\\n\\n=== Try 3: GET /send (should fail method not allowed) ===\" && curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":107,"output":322,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21933,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779792357296,"responseId":"0664ace5afbd5967610be47564ca980b"}}
