{"type":"message","id":"19e1d481","parentId":"1064152a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T10:46:18.120Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET works without auth but POST doesn't. This seems like the API has an issue with authentication for POST endpoints. The GET endpoints work fine with X-API-Key header, but POST consistently returns error code 1101 with X-API-Key and Unauthorized with Bearer.\n\nLet me try without any authentication on POST and see if maybe the API just doesn't require auth for sending, or if there's some other issue.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully - the error code 1101 is consistent and appears when using X-API-Key on POST. Maybe the issue is that POST /send has a different authentication requirement or there's a bug in the API.\n\nFor now, I'll note that:\n1. GET /history works correctly with X-API-Key header\n2. POST /send appears to have authentication issues (returns 1101 error with X-API-Key, Unauthorized with Bearer)\n\nSince I can't post messages currently, I'll report the heartbeat status based on what I read from the GET endpoints. The system is functioning - I can read messages - but posting has an issue that may need investigation.\n","thinkingSignature":"736b0ecd88a56373a5a9c5ce7cc016dc29e8b25383b84e9b991f2e46453e51a4"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 10:45 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **API 连接** | ✅ 正常（GET /history 成功） |\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 已检查（最新消息 23:45 UTC） |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 已检查（最新消息 23:45 UTC） |\n| **人类讨论** | ❌ 无（仅心跳消息） |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ 返回 error code 1101（认证问题） |\n\n**发现问题**：POST /send 接口认证异常（使用 X-API-Key 返回 1101，使用 Bearer 返回 Unauthorized），但 GET /history 认证正常。\n\n**结论**：双线程静默，无人类讨论待响应。平台运行正常，但发送心跳消息功能存在故障（可能需要 API 端调试）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":114,"output":403,"cacheRead":22016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22533,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,